{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S02、S04、S06、S11等段的感受短词仍然偏密，水波、小船等意象也有重复，个别抽象联想会分散注意力；Y的左右分栏和连续叙述在阅读流畅度上更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X最明显的优势是加亮词能让观众迅速抓住每段心理落点，感受的小字层级和按乐句出现的时间安排，也让观众不必一次读完所有短词，就能边听边获得信息。它对人物为什么收住、为什么放松、为什么又害怕失去，以及最后为什么选择不再隐藏，交代得更细，音乐变化对应的身体感受和情绪质地也更具体。Y的叙事更顺畅、分栏更清楚，尤其结尾与开头形成了很好的呼应，但部分细微心理转折和音乐表现被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e7b5dc3e-f791-4800-83a5-16035d3446bb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011033580417Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:11:54.762751+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8867bb056f38e8bc877e7c0a3abb42ecab0aad224a08894fece0bf71b3a1629e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f6